WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.053
AI can build almost anything today – when it's planned well.

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:08.799
Your AI department, alongside the people you have.

00:00:08.799 --> 00:00:11.588
We think, build and keep it in order with you.

00:00:12.438 --> 00:00:15.475
Or build it yourself with AI: three meetings,

00:00:15.475 --> 00:00:19.455
three personal booklets and a check-up about a month later.

00:00:20.305 --> 00:00:22.626
A small selection of what we've built.

00:00:23.476 --> 00:00:27.555
Meetings that turn into tasks. Nobody has to take minutes.

00:00:29.809 --> 00:00:32.356
Quality assurance of three thousand calls a day.

00:00:32.356 --> 00:00:34.425
Our own speech model checks every call,

00:00:34.425 --> 00:00:36.653
and the audio never leaves our own server.

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:41.393
A customer CRM that updates itself. One page per customer.

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:47.690
The inbox, sorted: AI puts the emails into three piles.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:52.220
A referral platform where employees recommend through a personal link.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.871
The content machine: AI writes with sources,

00:00:56.871 --> 00:00:58.930
and another AI reads it through.

00:00:59.957 --> 00:01:02.961
A participant system for Berlingske's Image Analysis.

00:01:02.961 --> 00:01:04.888
Only humans count as participants.

00:01:05.738 --> 00:01:08.459
An AI receptionist that takes every call and

00:01:08.459 --> 00:01:10.995
forwards the relevant ones straight away.

00:01:11.988 --> 00:01:16.570
Forbrugeragenten: an AI agent that writes to the providers for you.

00:01:17.488 --> 00:01:21.342
Browser MCP: your AI assistant in your own Chrome.

00:01:22.488 --> 00:01:26.177
Computer MCP: work by voice, away from the screen.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.894
Get ahead with AI in our mentoring program.

00:01:33.738 --> 00:01:36.354
Your data, your knowledge, your rules.

00:01:36.354 --> 00:01:40.278
You approve customer contact, money and contract changes.

00:01:41.128 --> 00:01:45.070
Put AI to work for your company. Book a free twenty-minute call.
